 magical!</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="7519c5f5-21df-4e80-8a18-58b6c1c0ce81" class="r-1l7b73j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>"My kids were amazed watching the little figures come to life in water! It’s such a fun and creative activity. Easy to use, mess-free, and totally unique. We’ve already ordered another kit for a birthday gift!"</p></span></div><div data-rid="dadb7a23-cb97-4eaf-8dec-5cc79e3e9936" class="r-u35fq0"><div data-rid="1f07ba7f-88a7-457f-a595-83341d5893f8" class="r-n6h7zj"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1u0drvx" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0m-3.97-3.03a.75.75 0 0 0-1.08.022L7.477 9.417 5.384 7.323a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06L6.97 11.03a.75.75 0 0 0 1.079-.02l3.992-4.99a.75.75 0 0 0-.01-1.05z"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="23539e17-dc04-43b3-81f3-644a7ad7d5b6" class="r-1j2lc52 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Jane D.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="63f2eba2-af9d-4b86-b766-55dd781cf90e" class="r-zn27er"><div data-rid="708e6691-d1da-4d35-b8ae-f24689b7a6ae" class="r-caa4gq"><div data-rid="7f6094e0-9285-4b0e-93de-18aa8f947b81" class="r-uycj2y alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>5.</p></span></div><div data-rid="cc494235-4488-4a3e-8875-d15cf38804a5" class="r-15f3l2k alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>It's Reusable! No Plastic Waste</p></span></div><div data-rid="e3d31fca-07ea-4558-a606-eb070617290e" class="r-tawg0n alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Magic Water Elf Kit is designed to be safe for kids <em>and</em> gentle on the planet. The powder is made from food-grade calcium lactate (<strong>commonly used in cheese and fruit preservation</strong>), while the gels come from sodium alginate (<strong>a natural compound derived from seaweed</strong>). It’s 100% non-toxic, biodegradable, and completely reusable.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="b4912075-dea2-46c4-9257-2930ed3bac31" class="r-oi7zot"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/f883d5ab-79a6-45c1-8315-7641064b65d1/2c615608-f818-431c-8e80-7fd708a55beb?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/f883d5ab-79a6-45c1-8315-7641064b65d1/2c615608-f818-431c-8e80-7fd708a55beb?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/f883d5ab-79a6-45c1-8315-7641064b65d1/2c615608-f818-431c-8e80-7fd708a55beb?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/f883d5ab-79a6-45c1-8315-7641064b65d1/2c615608-f818-431c-8e80-7fd708a55beb" class="r-9tdp9u" loading="lazy"/></picture></div></div><div data-rid="6172b956-0389-49e2-ab21-b9024aa7ddbf" class="r-15g3950"><div data-rid="ea002d44-d2cd-4e6f-9a0d-61795a8de863" class="r-a4ysz1" id="replo-carousel::R5b2:" role="region" aria-label="Carousel" data-replo-carousel="true"><button type="button" data-replo-component-root="carousel" data-replo-part="nav-button" data-direction="previous" aria-label="Previous slide" disabled="" data-rid="ae35017d-97b8-4669-8f54-d044901492d7" class="r-gygbnu r-1bycuqf"><div data-rid="7cb7212e-1df3-42cb-a161-8659a58991fc" class="r-n30toq"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-rsbpwt" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M11.354 1.646a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708L5.707 8l5.647 5.646a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708l6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0"></path></svg></div></button><div data-rid="3c54f026-2093-403f-a0fc-1a39ef703d87" class="r-abky7n"><div data-replo-component-root="carousel" data-replo-part="slides" data-replo-root-id="replo-carousel:R5db2:" data-orientation="hor